<title>USA: Limited Q1 EPS $0.07 excluding IPO gain.</title>
<headline>Limited Q1 EPS $0.07 excluding IPO gain.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Limited Inc said Monday its earnings per share for the first quarter ended May 3 were $0.07, excluding a gain of $0.02 a share from its initial public offering of Brylane Inc.</p>
<p>In the year-ago first quarter Limited said it reported pro forma earnings per share of $0.08.</p>
<p>Limited said including the Brylane IPO, it had earnings of $24.9 million, or $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>Brylane is a specialty catalogue retailer 26 percent-owned by Limited.</p>
</text>
